iew-box=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A5B4FC\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3h18v18H3zM8.5 10a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3zM21 15l-5-5L5 21\"></path></svg>\n<strong style=\"color: #F5F7FB\">HOME-03 · Founder portrait</strong>\n<span>Real photo of you at your desk, natural light · 1200×1500</span>\n</div>\n<blockquote style=\"margin: 0; padding: 22px; border-radius: 16px; background: #121A2B; border: 1px solid #1E2738; color: #D5DBE8; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6\">“[FOUNDER QUOTE: one or two sentences on why you run Delvix this way.]”<footer style=\"margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: #A3ADC2\">[Founder name], Founder, Delvix Studio</footer></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 8. INDUSTRIES -->\n<section style=\"background: #FFFFFF; color: #0B1220; padding: 112px 24px\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 48px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; max-width: 700px\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4F46E5\">Industries</span>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.6vw, 44px); line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 800\">Built for businesses that run on operations.</h2>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 20px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{industries}}\" as=\"i\" hint-placeholder-count=\"8\">\n<a href=\"{{i.href}}\" class=\"dx-card\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #E4E7EF; overflow: hidden; background: #FFFFFF; color: #0B1220; text-decoration: none\">\n<div style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #C9CEDB; background: #F5F7FB; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; padding: 16px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #4B5568\">\n<strong style=\"color: #0B1220; font-size: 13px\">{{i.img}}</strong><span>{{i.imgNote}}</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 20px 22px 24px\">\n<span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4F46E5\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"{{i.icon}}\"></path></svg><strong style=\"font-size: 17px\">{{i.title}}</strong></span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: #4B5568\">{{i.text}}</span>\n</div>\n</a>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 9. FEATURED CASE STUDY -->\n<section id=\"work\" style=\"background: #0B1220; padding: 112px 24px\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; max-width: 700px\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #A5B4FC\">Our work</span>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.6vw, 44px); line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 800; color: #F5F7FB\">Real projects, real screenshots.</h2>\n</div>\n<a href=\"/work\" style=\"font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">All case studies →</a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; border-radius: 22px; border: 1px solid #1E2738; background: #121A2B; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 520px; min-width: 0; padding: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px\">\n<span style=\"padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #1B2340; color: #C7D2FE; font-size: 13px\">Featured</span>\n<span style=\"padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #2A3550; color: #A3ADC2; font-size: 13px\">B2B SaaS</span>\n<span style=\"padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #2A3550; color: #A3ADC2; font-size: 13px\">AI + automation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: #F5F7FB\">Delvix Revenue OS</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #A3ADC2\">A multi-tenant SaaS that finds businesses, audits their websites in a real browser, writes evidence-based outreach and handles replies with AI. Billing, credits and a Super Admin console included.</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{csStack}}\" as=\"t\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\"><span style=\"padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 8px; background: #0B1220; border: 1px solid #1E2738; color: #D5DBE8; font-size: 13px\">{{t}}</span></sc-for>\n</div>\n<a href=\"/work/revenue-os\" style=\"align-self: flex-start; margin-top: 8px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 14px 22px; border-radius: 12px; background: #6366F1; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">Read the case study</a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 520px; min-width: 0; padding: 24px; display: flex\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 340px; border-radius: 14px; border: 1.5px dashed #3A4660; background: #0E1626; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; color: #A3ADC2; font-size: 14px\">\n<svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A5B4FC\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3h18v18H3zM8.5 10a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3zM21 15l-5-5L5 21\"></path></svg>\n<strong style=\"color: #F5F7FB\">HOME-04 · Revenue OS pipeline</strong>\n<span>Real screenshot of the pipeline or Super Admin packages · 1400×1000</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 10. FREE AUDIT BAND -->\n<section style=\"background: #4F46E5; padding: 96px 24px; color: #FFFFFF\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 56px; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 460px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #E0E7FF\">Free, no sales pitch</span>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.6vw, 44px); line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 800\">Get a free website &amp; systems audit.</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #E0E7FF\">We open your site on a real phone and desktop browser and send you a short report with screenshots: what's broken, what's slowing you down, and what to fix first.</p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 10px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{auditChecks}}\" as=\"ac\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\"><span style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"flex: 0 0 18px; margin-top: 2px\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>{{ac}}</span></sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n<form style=\"flex: 1 1 400px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; padding: 32px; border-radius: 20px; background: #FFFFFF; color: #0B1220; box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(11,18,32,0.3)\">\n<strong style=\"font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 20px\">Request your audit</strong>\n<label style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500\">Name<input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your name\" style=\"padding: 13px 14px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #C9CEDB; font-size: 15px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif\"></label>\n<label style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500\">Work email<input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" style=\"padding: 13px 14px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #C9CEDB; font-size: 15px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif\"></label>\n<label style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500\">Website<input type=\"url\" placeholder=\"https://yourcompany.com\" style=\"padding: 13px 14px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #C9CEDB; font-size: 15px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif\"></label>\n<label style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500\">Biggest problem<sc-raw-select style=\"padding: 13px 14px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #C9CEDB; font-size: 15px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; background: #FFFFFF\"><option>Running on spreadsheets</option><option>Too much manual work</option><option>Outdated website</option><option>Need an app</option><option>Something else</option></sc-raw-select></label>\n<button type=\"button\" style=\"margin-top: 6px; padding: 15px 20px; border-radius: 12px; border: 0; background: #0B1220; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; cursor: pointer\">Send me the audit</button>\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4B5568\">Report in your inbox within [2 business days].</span>\n</form>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 11. TECH STACK -->\n<section style=\"background: #FFFFFF; color: #0B1220; padding: 112px 24px\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; max-width: 700px\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4F46E5\">Technology</span>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.6vw, 44px); line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 800\">A modern stack, chosen for your project.</h2>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr)); gap: 16px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{stack}}\" as=\"g\" hint-placeholder-count=\"5\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; padding: 24px; border-radius: 16px; background: #F5F7FB\">\n<strong style=\"font-size: 15px\">{{g.group}}</strong>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{g.items}}\" as=\"it\" hint-placeholder-count=\"3\"><span style=\"padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 8px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E4E7EF; font-size: 14px\">{{it}}</span></sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 12. FAQ -->\n<section style=\"background: #F5F7FB; color: #0B1220; padding: 112px 24px\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 36px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; text-align: center; align-items: center\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4F46E5\">FAQ</span>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.6vw, 44px); line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 800\">Questions we hear before every project.</h2>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{faq}}\" as=\"f\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\">\n<details style=\"border-radius: 14px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E4E7EF; padding: 20px 24px\">\n<summary style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px\">{{f.q}}<svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4F46E5\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"flex: 0 0 20px\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary>\n<p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; color: #4B5568\">{{f.a}}</p>\n</details>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 13. FINAL CTA -->\n<section id=\"book\" style=\"background: #0B1220; padding: 112px 24px\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 56px; align-items: center; padding: 56px; border-radius: 28px; border: 1px solid #1E2738; background: #121A2B\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 480px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.6vw, 46px); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 800; color: #F5F7FB\">Tell us what you're running on today.</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #A3ADC2\">A free 30-minute call. You leave with a clear next step, whether or not you work with us.</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px\">\n<a href=\"#\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 16px 26px; border-radius: 12px; background: #6366F1; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\">Book a free call</a>\n<a href=\"#\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 16px 26px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #2A3550; color: #F5F7FB; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path></svg>Chat on WhatsApp</a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{promisesShort}}\" as=\"p\" hint-placeholder-count=\"3\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: #D5DBE8\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A5B4FC\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>{{p}}</span></sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 360px; min-width: 0; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: 18px; border: 1.5px dashed #3A4660; background: #0E1626; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; color: #A3ADC2; font-size: 14px\">\n<svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A5B4FC\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3h18v18H3zM8.5 10a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3zM21 15l-5-5L5 21\"></path></svg>\n<strong style=\"color: #F5F7FB\">HOME-05 · You on a call</strong>\n<span>Real photo: you on a video call with a client or demoing on screen · 1200×900</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<dc-import name=\"Footer\" hint-size=\"100%,560px\"></dc-import>\n</div>\n</x-dc>\n<script type=\"text/x-dc\" data-dc-script=\"\" data-props=\"{&quot;$preview&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:1440,&quot;height&quot;:7600}}\">\nclass Component extends DCLogic {\n  renderVals() {\n    const I = {\n      globe: 'M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20a10 10 0 1 0 0-20zM2 12h20M12 2c3 3 3 17 0 20M12 2c-3 3-3 17 0 20',\n      phone: 'M7 2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2zM11 18h2',\n      boxes: 'M3 7l9-4 9 4-9 4-9-4zM3 7v10l9 4 9-4V7M12 11v10',\n      users: 'M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2M9 11a4 4 0 1 0 0-8a4 4 0 0 0 0 8zM22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9M16 3.1a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.8',\n      cloud: 'M17.5 19H7a5 5 0 1 1 1-9.9A6 6 0 0 1 19.5 11 4 4 0 0 1 17.5 19z',\n      flow: 'M4 4h6v6H4zM14 14h6v6h-6zM7 10v4a3 3 0 0 0 3 3h4',\n      spark: 'M12 3l1.8 4.7L18.5 9.5l-4.7 1.8L12 16l-1.8-4.7L5.5 9.5l4.7-1.8zM19 15l.8 2.2L22 18l-2.2.8L19 21l-.8-2.2L16 18l2.2-.8z',\n      buoy: 'M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20a10 10 0 1 0 0-20zM12 8a4 4 0 1 0 0 8a4 4 0 1 0 0-8zM4.9 4.9l4.3 4.3M14.8 14.8l4.3 4.3M1